{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in a multiprofile setting with avgpool aggregation, isolating encoder choice from other variables. Validation accuracy (0.5305) and F1 (0.5152) are lower than the PCA-based multiprofile baseline (config_002), suggesting scgpt may underperform compared to PCA in this context. Uncertainty remains about whether encoder-specific factors or aggregation methods drive performance differences, as scvi_n200 (config_003) showed higher performance with the same aggregation."
}

